On Mon, Sep 15, 2014 at 07:49:21AM -0700, Jim Davis wrote:
> Building with the attached random configuration file,
> 
> drivers/built-in.o: In function `ntc_thermistor_remove':
> ntc_thermistor.c:(.text+0xfffc5): undefined reference to
> `thermal_zone_of_sensor_unregister'
> make: *** [vmlinux] Error 1

Interesting error. I don't immediately see what is causing it.

Jonghwa, I am dropping your patch 'hwmon: (ntc_thermistor) Add ntc thermistor
to thermal subsystem as a sensor' from hwmon-next until this is resolved.

Thanks,
Guenter

